"parent_covered": ["Explains that the Ring of Nestor lacks secure excavation 
documentation and that its reported discovery and findspot rest on later 
collection narratives and secondary accounts, making its archaeological context 
unreliable (Hudler 2019; Cambridge ‘Fakes and Dubitanda’ chapter; “Ring of 
Nestor” article).", "Clarifies that multiple scholars classify the ring among 
