{"query": {"id": "20260628181745557236_21c25b72", "handle": "q2.1", "text": 
"\"Ring of Nestor\" Evans 1925 gold ring physical measurements weight Heidelberg
diglit", "importance": "supporting"}, "items": [{"id": 
"20260628181859095157_cf42cac0", "type": "Evidence", "text": "“Evans, Arthur J. 
‘The ring of Nestor’. A glimpse into the Minoan after-world and a sepulchral 
treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, Boeotia. London, 
1925.”", "source_ids": ["20260628181453787298_5a75f9f3"], "citations": [2]}, 
