'paragraph', 'text': 'Across these discussions, a broad methodological consensus
has emerged that the Ring of Nestor should not serve as core or decisive 
evidence for reconstructing Bronze Age religious spaces, rituals, or 
cross-cultural interaction. Hudler argues that artifacts lacking reliable find 
